<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Viacom cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Viacom cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it downgraded Viacom Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Earlier, Viacom announced it would issue shares tracking the performance of its Blockbuster unit and said Q1 cash flow at the unit would be 15-20 percent below year-ago levels.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3-3/4 to 26-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
